@startuml
node "User workstation" {
  artifact "Browser UI\nHTML / CSS / JavaScript" as UI
}
node "Local Node.js process" {
  component "HTTP service\nloopback only :4234" as API
  component "ethers test signers" as Signers
  node "Hardhat simulated EVM\nchain 31337" {
    artifact "SafeguardAssurance.sol" as Contract
  }
}
database "Synthetic JSON / review exports\nOff-chain preimages" as Data
UI --> API : same-origin HTTP
API --> Signers : selected prototype actor
Signers --> Contract : signed transactions
Contract --> API : state and event logs
API --> Data : read / hash / export
note bottom of Contract : Implemented: isolated local EVM.\nProduction proposal: independently governed\npermissioned EVM validators and personal signing.\nNo production OTA connection is implemented.
@enduml
